review_text:
After slogging through three books in this story, I was really, really ready for all the answers to be revealed. I was so impatient reading through Book 2 
 and this one that it was a bit frustrating. And some of these dystopia novels are a bit depressing (like 
 ). But I will say that the ending of this final book, the very, VERY end, was very satisfying and made reading it all worth it.
